\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 The Forward Process\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 We begin with:\
H1 \uc0\u8594  Hypothesis of macro movement.\
Then:\
H2 \uc0\u8594  Proposed internal development of that movement.\
Then:\
H3 \uc0\u8594  The text itself.\
So forward movement is:\
H1 \uc0\u8594  H2 \u8594  H3\
This is exploratory.\uc0\u8232 It\'92s how we begin reading.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 But Validation Runs Backwards\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The real confirmation runs:\
H3 \uc0\u8594  H2 \u8594  H1\
If:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls37\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The verses (H3) do not naturally support the internal development (H2),\uc0\u8232 then H2 is wrong.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 If:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls38\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The internal development collapses under the verses,\uc0\u8232 then the macro hypothesis (H1) is wrong.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 That is brilliant structural humility.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Why This Is Necessary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 If we tried to start from H3 upward every time:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls39\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 It becomes microscopic.\
\ls39\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 It becomes exhausting.\
\ls39\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 It loses flow.\
\ls39\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 It becomes overly atomized.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 So H1 is a reading hypothesis.\uc0\u8232 Not a conclusion.\
That is crucial.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 This Prevents Two Extremes\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 It prevents:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls40\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Imposed macro structure (because H3 can veto it)\
\ls40\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Fragmented micro reading (because H1 gives direction)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 It is iterative, not linear.\
