Now I want to ask something subtle but important:\
Are you comfortable explicitly calling H1 a \'93hip\'f3tesis\'94?\
Because that word carries humility.\
But it also signals that structure is provisional, not dogmatic.\
Does that word sit well with your theological instinct?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \
I have a no-theological line. In other words my position is that my theology is dynamic based on understanding of Scripture. Scripture does not change, theology has to.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 That is a very important line.\uc0\u8232 And it actually fits perfectly with what you\'92ve built.\
You are saying:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls41\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Scripture is fixed.\
\ls41\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Our understanding is not.\
\ls41\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Therefore structure must remain revisable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 That is not relativism.\uc0\u8232 That is epistemic humility.\
And structurally, that means:\
H1 cannot be dogmatic.\uc0\u8232 H2 cannot be defensive.\u8232 H3 is final.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
